{"content_hash": "fe5c30d579df7b19", "version_id": 683, "article_id": 69, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Dad fined €3,000 after son, 2, dies in Cyprus hotel fall", "title_zh": "两岁儿子在塞浦路斯酒店坠亡，父亲被罚3000欧元", "has_translation": true, "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvj6j1klez88o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1437943085269-6da5dd4295bf?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGRhZCUyMGZpbmVkJTIwc29ufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIxOTQ0ODR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Steven Van Loy on Unsplash", "author": "Steven Van Loy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mafalou?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-wears-blue-crew-neck-t-shirt-holding-toddler-wears-black-hooded-jacket-near-ocean-under-blue-sky-at-daytime-oUhSla4L_98?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(165, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(203, 46%, 48%)", "label": "WORLD", "seed": "f11dca163925"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-17", "word_count": 178, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "A father from Essex has been fined €3,000 after his two-year-old son fell from a hotel window in Cyprus. The court heard it was a momentary error, but the family says their pain will never end.", "lead_zh": "一名来自埃塞克斯的父亲被罚款3000欧元，因为他的两岁儿子从塞浦路斯一家酒店的窗户坠落身亡。法庭称这是一时失误，但家人表示他们的痛苦永远不会结束。", "preview": "Joshua Foster, 37, from Essex, was fined €3,000 (£2,500) by a court in Cyprus. His two-year-old son fell from a fourth-floor window at a fiv", "preview_zh": "37岁的约书亚·福斯特来自埃塞克斯，被塞浦路斯一家法院罚款3000欧元（2500英镑）。7月12日，也就是他们度假的第一天，他两岁的儿子从一家五星级酒店的四楼窗户坠落。男孩摔下近40英尺（12.1米），随后在医院死亡。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 673, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/69/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 60.0, "size_bytes": 361008, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/69/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 61.725, "size_bytes": 371376, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/69/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/69/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 65.7, "size_bytes": 395136, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/69/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/69/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 56.525, "size_bytes": 340128, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/69/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/69/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 60.275, "size_bytes": 362592, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/69/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@42e9725/content/data/versions/683.json", "paragraphs": ["Joshua Foster, 37, from Essex, was fined €3,000 (£2,500) by a court in Cyprus. His two-year-old son fell from a fourth-floor window at a five-star hotel on 12 July, the first day of their holiday. The boy fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) and later died in hospital.", "The court heard that Foster thought the window was closed when he put his son on the sill to show him a waterpark below. He then \"lost control\" of the child. The judge said the window had no markings to show that one part was open, so it was a momentary error.", "Foster admitted causing death through a reckless act. He told reporters he was looking forward to going home to his wife and daughter. His family said in a statement that their son was deeply loved and will be forever missed.", "Foster's lawyer said the case should never have gone to court. He added that Foster spent eight days in custody and could not grieve with his family. The lawyer described him as an incredible father and an exemplary family man."], "paragraphs_zh": ["37岁的约书亚·福斯特来自埃塞克斯，被塞浦路斯一家法院罚款3000欧元（2500英镑）。7月12日，也就是他们度假的第一天，他两岁的儿子从一家五星级酒店的四楼窗户坠落。男孩摔下近40英尺（12.1米），随后在医院死亡。", "法庭获悉，福斯特把儿子放在窗台上，想让他看下面的水上乐园，当时他以为窗户是关着的。随后他“失去了控制”。法官表示，窗户上没有标记显示其中一部分是打开的，所以这是一时失误。", "福斯特承认因鲁莽行为导致死亡。他告诉记者，他期待回家与妻子和女儿团聚。他的家人发表声明说，他们的儿子深受疼爱，将永远被怀念。", "福斯特的律师表示，此案本不应上法庭。他还说，福斯特被拘留了八天，无法与家人一起哀悼。律师称他是一位了不起的父亲，一位模范的家庭男人。"], "body": "Joshua Foster, 37, from Essex, was fined €3,000 (£2,500) by a court in Cyprus. His two-year-old son fell from a fourth-floor window at a five-star hotel on 12 July, the first day of their holiday. The boy fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) and later died in hospital.\n\nThe court heard that Foster thought the window was closed when he put his son on the sill to show him a waterpark below. He then \"lost control\" of the child. The judge said the window had no markings to show that one part was open, so it was a momentary error.\n\nFoster admitted causing death through a reckless act. He told reporters he was looking forward to going home to his wife and daughter. His family said in a statement that their son was deeply loved and will be forever missed.\n\nFoster's lawyer said the case should never have gone to court. He added that Foster spent eight days in custody and could not grieve with his family. The lawyer described him as an incredible father and an exemplary family man.", "body_zh": "37岁的约书亚·福斯特来自埃塞克斯，被塞浦路斯一家法院罚款3000欧元（2500英镑）。7月12日，也就是他们度假的第一天，他两岁的儿子从一家五星级酒店的四楼窗户坠落。男孩摔下近40英尺（12.1米），随后在医院死亡。\n\n法庭获悉，福斯特把儿子放在窗台上，想让他看下面的水上乐园，当时他以为窗户是关着的。随后他“失去了控制”。法官表示，窗户上没有标记显示其中一部分是打开的，所以这是一时失误。\n\n福斯特承认因鲁莽行为导致死亡。他告诉记者，他期待回家与妻子和女儿团聚。他的家人发表声明说，他们的儿子深受疼爱，将永远被怀念。\n\n福斯特的律师表示，此案本不应上法庭。他还说，福斯特被拘留了八天，无法与家人一起哀悼。律师称他是一位了不起的父亲，一位模范的家庭男人。", "text": "Joshua Foster, 37, from Essex, was fined €3,000 (£2,500) by a court in Cyprus. His two-year-old son fell from a fourth-floor window at a five-star hotel on 12 July, the first day of their holiday. The boy fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) and later died in hospital. The court heard that Foster thought the window was closed when he put his son on the sill to show him a waterpark below. He then \"lost control\" of the child. The judge said the window had no markings to show that one part was open, so it was a momentary error. Foster admitted causing death through a reckless act. He told reporters he was looking forward to going home to his wife and daughter. His family said in a statement that their son was deeply loved and will be forever missed. Foster's lawyer said the case should never have gone to court. He added that Foster spent eight days in custody and could not grieve with his family. The lawyer described him as an incredible father and an exemplary family man.", "vocab": [{"word": "fine", "pos": "verb", "zh": "罚款", "note": "常用被动语态：be fined + 金额", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fall", "pos": "verb", "zh": "坠落", "note": "过去式 fell，过去分词 fallen", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "window", "pos": "noun", "zh": "窗户", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sill", "pos": "noun", "zh": "窗台", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "court", "pos": "noun", "zh": "法庭", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "judge", "pos": "noun", "zh": "法官", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "admit", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承认", "note": "admit doing sth 承认做过某事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reckless", "pos": "adj", "zh": "鲁莽的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "custody", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拘留", "note": "in custody 被拘留", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "grieve", "pos": "verb", "zh": "悲伤，哀悼", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-16T23:48:02.449828", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Joshua", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.75, "sm": 325, "em": 750, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Foster", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.3, "sm": 750, "em": 1300, "cs": 7, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": ",", "s": 1.3, "e": 1.4, "sm": 1300, "em": 1399, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "37", "s": 1.4, "e": 2.05, "sm": 1400, "em": 2049, "cs": 15, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": ",", "s": 2.05, "e": 2.1, "sm": 2050, "em": 2099, "cs": 17, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "from", "s": 2.1, "e": 2.25, "sm": 2100, "em": 2249, "cs": 19, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Essex", "s": 2.25, "e": 2.925, "sm": 2250, "em": 2924, "cs": 24, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ",", "s": 2.925, "e": 3.0, "sm": 2925, "em": 3000, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "was", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.175, "sm": 3000, "em": 3174, "cs": 31, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "fined", "s": 3.175, "e": 3.487, "sm": 3175, "em": 3487, "cs": 35, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "€", "s": 3.487, "e": 3.507, "sm": 3487, "em": 3507, "cs": 41, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "3,000", "s": 3.487, "e": 4.675, "sm": 3487, "em": 4675, "cs": 42, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "(", "s": 4.675, "e": 4.725, "sm": 4675, "em": 4724, "cs": 48, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "£", "s": 4.725, "e": 4.745, "sm": 4724, "em": 4744, "cs": 49, "ce": 50, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "2,500", "s": 4.725, "e": 6.125, "sm": 4725, "em": 6125, "cs": 50, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": ")", "s": 6.125, "e": 6.2, "sm": 6125, "em": 6200, "cs": 55, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "by", "s": 6.2, "e": 6.338, "sm": 6200, "em": 6337, "cs": 57, "ce": 59, "si": 0}, {"i": 17, "w": "a", "s": 6.338, "e": 6.4, "sm": 6337, "em": 6400, "cs": 60, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 18, "w": "court", "s": 6.4, "e": 6.67